tenant/receipt/ReceiptLine.java — id, receipt_id, product_id, destination_location_id (must be non-DISPATCH kind), qty, lot_number, expiry_date, notes
tenant/receipt/ReceiptStatus.java (enum)
tenant/receipt/ReceiptDocumentRepository.java
tenant/receipt/ReceiptLineRepository.java
